  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h3 data-end=\"123\" data-start=\"94\"><strong data-end=\"121\" data-start=\"98\">Brand Introduction:</strong></h3><p data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"124\">Huku Balance is a premium brand dedicated to designing high-quality wooden balance boards that enhance movement, strength, and coordination. Rooted in craftsmanship and sustainability, our products are engineered to inspire active lifestyles - whether for fitness, surfing, skateboarding, or general well-being.</p><h3 data-end=\"467\" data-start=\"437\"><strong data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"441\">Product Description:</strong></h3><p data-end=\"822\" data-start=\"468\">Our handcrafted balance boards are made from the finest Baltic Birch plywood and designed for all ages and skill levels. From our high-performance Nalu board to the playful Ulu board for kids, every Huku product encourages fun, engagement, and functional movement, making them the perfect addition to home workouts, office spaces, and surf training.</p><h3 data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"824\"><strong data-end=\"859\" data-start=\"828\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h3><ul data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"862\"><li data-end=\"920\" data-start=\"862\">Expertly crafted from sustainable Baltic Birch plywood</li><li data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"921\">Designed for fitness, sports training, and rehabilitation</li><li data-end=\"1046\" data-start=\"983\">Engaging designs, including puzzle-based balance challenges</li><li data-end=\"1116\" data-start=\"1047\">Used by athletes, fitness professionals, and wellness enthusiasts</li><li data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"1117\">100% made in Ireland with a focus on durability and aesthetics</li></ul><h3 data-end=\"1209\" data-start=\"1185\"><strong data-end=\"1207\" data-start=\"1189\">Payment Terms:</strong></h3><p data-end=\"1382\" data-start=\"1210\">Affiliates earn a competitive commission on every sale referred through their unique link. Payouts are made monthly via PayPal, with no minimum threshold for withdrawals.</p><h3 data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1384\"><strong data-end=\"1410\" data-start=\"1388\">Other Information:</strong></h3><ul data-end=\"1591\" data-start=\"1413\"><li data-end=\"1473\" data-start=\"1413\">Dedicated support and marketing resources for affiliates</li><li data-end=\"1527\" data-start=\"1474\">Access to exclusive discount codes and promotions</li><li data-end=\"1591\" data-start=\"1528\">Global shipping available, making it easy to sell worldwide</li></ul></div>",
